                        <h3>Safety and Code Compliance</h3>
                        <p>DIY generator connections are dangerous and illegal. Our professional installation ensures:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>No backfeeding:</strong> Interlock prevents sending power to utility lines</li>
                            <li><strong>Proper grounding:</strong> Protects against electrical faults</li>
                            <li><strong>Permit and inspection:</strong> Meets all local codes</li>
                            <li><strong>Insurance compliance:</strong> Documented professional installation</li>
                            <li><strong>Carbon monoxide safety:</strong> Proper placement guidance</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h3>Who Should Choose Portable + Interlock?</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Have existing generator or want portable option</li>
                            <li>Occasional outages (few times per year)</li>
                            <li>Comfortable with manual switchover</li>
                            <li>Want 50-amp power for all lights/outlets</li>
                            <li>Interested in tri-fuel flexibility</li>
                            <li>May move in next few years</li>
                        </ul>
